344
00:26:49.560 --> 00:26:51.600
We're missing both Ultras, though?

345
00:26:54.200 --> 00:26:58.760
Then there's no way he would rate--
The second Ultra is main stage.

346
00:26:58.840 --> 00:27:01.160
The reason they're saying to you now...

347
00:27:01.240 --> 00:27:03.960
The first Ultra doesn't really matter
