387
00:29:42.520 --> 00:29:44.360
We feel no pain.

388
00:29:48.480 --> 00:29:50.480
Tim is a hard worker, man.

389
00:30:10.680 --> 00:30:12.360
I can't eat anything.

390
00:30:14.080 --> 00:30:18.400
'Cause as an artist, they just
want us on the beat like a machine.

391
00:30:18.480 --> 00:30:20.440
Duh-duh-duh-duh-duh...

392
00:30:21.120 --> 00:30:22.840
And then you burn out.

393
00:30:30.840 --> 00:30:34.160
The hospital visit has stuck
in my mind as

394
00:30:34.240 --> 00:30:36.160
an extremely terrible experience,

395
00:30:36.240 --> 00:30:41.560
but it didn't bother me as much
