397
00:30:45.200 --> 00:30:47.616
The second you open your eyes,
you're like...

398
00:30:47.640 --> 00:30:48.920
Your stomach is hurting.

399
00:30:49.000 --> 00:30:52.880
When you're moving, you're hurting.
The pain medicine made me feel shitty.

400
