All of a sudden,
"Wake Me Up" becomes huge.

404
00:31:08.200 --> 00:31:10.360
Everything took off in summer 2013.

405
00:31:10.440 --> 00:31:11.440
Here we go!

406
00:31:29.200 --> 00:31:32.080
My life was a dream to so many people.

407
00:31:32.160 --> 00:31:34.440
I am including myself. It was a dream.

408
00:31:34.520 --> 00:31:36.520
House music and-- and dance music

409
00:31:36.600 --> 00:31:40.800
