445
00:34:15.840 --> 00:34:18.040
He's very innovative in his melodies.

446
00:34:18.120 --> 00:34:20.239
You know, he did "Levels", "Wake Me Up".

447
00:34:20.320 --> 00:34:24.280
And those two songs were not with,
